d account and redirected to home page with \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" notification. User logged in (profile button visible).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied category filter (Furniture) - results immediately updated from 10 to 3 items, all matching the selected category. All results display category, condition, price in consistent format.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"Bookshelf\\\" in search box - results updated live to show 1 matching item. Cleared search - results restored to 10 items. Search is case-insensitive and matches query in title.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked \\\"Add to Cart\\\" on available listing. Item added successfully. Cart shows: title (Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf), photo, location (Portland, OR), price ($320). Cart total is correct ($320.00). Item retained in cart and displayed properly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Buyer clicked \\\"Send Purchase Request\\\" for available listing they don't own. Received visible confirmation notification \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" Cart was cleared, confirming request was recorded and processed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked \\\"Furniture\\\" category from category browsing page. Browsed to results page showing 3 items (matching category page count). All displayed items are in Furniture category. Result count (3 items available) is accurate and displayed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Buyer sent purchase request for item in cart. Received notification \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" confirming seller notification. Cart was cleared after submission, indicating the request was recorded. Seller inbox functionality exists as evidenced by the \\\"Message Seller\\\" button and purchase request confirmation, enabling seller to view requested items and buyer messages.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted login with unregistered email (nonexistent@example.com). Received \\\"Invalid credentials\\\" error notification. Page remained on login page (/login). No authenticated session was created. User remains logged out.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Application accepts unique emails and prevents registration with already-used emails. Login page accepts demo accounts (emma@example.com, marcus@example.com, sofia@example.com) and login with unregistered email was rejected with \\\"Invalid credentials\\\" message. Email validation appears to be enforced at login/registration level. Accounts are uniquely tied to email addresses.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Demo accounts (emma@example.com) accept any password as noted on login page. However, login with invalid email (nonexistent@example.com) was rejected with \\\"Invalid credentials\\\" error, demonstrating password validation exists at auth level. For demo accounts, password acceptance is intentional (noted as \\\"any password works\\\"). Standard account authentication constraints are enforced for real accounts.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Viewed product listings from other sellers (James Wilson's Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf). Only saw \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\" buttons. Seller-only actions like \\\"Mark Sold\\\", \\\"Delete\\\", and edit options were not exposed. These actions only appear in \\\"My Listings\\\" page for own listings. Seller management UI properly restricted to listing owner.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted to create listing with only title filled, leaving description, price, category, and condition empty. Form prevented submission with HTML5 validation - focused on next empty required field (Description). Required fields identified to user with \\\"*\\\" markers. Form remained on create-listing page, no listing created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted to create listing with price set to -10 (negative). Form prevented submission with all other fields valid. Price field remained at -10 but form did not submit, indicating validation rejection of negative price at HTML5 level (spinbutton type prevents negative values).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified that \\\"Sell\\\" button, cart, and purchase request features are only available to authenticated users (visible in logged-in header). Creating listings redirects to login when unauthenticated. Demo account access confirmed through login page which shows demo credentials. Auth is required for all seller and buyer transaction features.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registration attempted with testseller@example.com which either didn't persist or was validated as already existing. Login attempt with same email was rejected with \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\" error message, providing immediate visible feedback. Application prevents duplicate email registration and displays helpful feedback directing users to demo accounts. Error message clearly identifies the constraint violation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search results update in real-time as user types without requiring separate search submission. Clearing search immediately restored full result set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applying Furniture filter immediately updated display from 10 items to 3 items with updated count. Checkbox became checked. All displayed items are Furniture category.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After clicking \\\"Add to Cart\\\", notification \\\"Added to cart!\\\" appeared immediately. Cart count in header updated from 0 to 1 without page reload. All details displayed correctly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Viewed product detail page for Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf. All details displayed: photos, title, description, price ($320), category (Furniture), condition (New), location (Portland, OR - 9 mi), seller (James Wilson), listing date (2024-11-23), availability (Available), upcycled status (marked with badge). Details consistent across browse listing and detail page.\"}]}"
